    counter-increment: footnotes; /* 1 */
    text-decoration: none; /* 2 */
    color: inherit; /* 2 */
    cursor: default; /* 2 */
    outline: none; /* 2 */
  }
  /** Actual numbered references
 1. Display the current state of the counter (e.g. `[1]`)
